# Runtime state. main ignores these caches; hf-deploy commits them so a fresh Space starts
# warm (.sentiment_history.csv, models/data/features_raw_v2.csv and features_meta.json,
# data/generation_cache_v2.csv). Version 1 of the coal and feature caches overstated
# energy fourfold and is never shipped.
data/generation_cache.csv
models/data/features_cache.csv
# Model weights are committed as JSON; binary formats are no longer written or read.
models/weights/*.pt
models/weights/*.joblib
models/weights/*.tmp

